RightToReply:
&lt;p&gt;
	Naturally, we are extremely disappointed with this result as we have always prided ourselves on maintaining high standards of cleanliness, food safety and hygiene. We do, however, fully acknowledge that on the day of the inspection, we fell short of the standards we expect of ourselves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
	&amp;nbsp;Since the inspection, we have taken proactive steps to review and reinforce our procedures. We have welcomed an independent third-party auditor to carry out an additional assessment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
	&amp;nbsp;The White Swan was awarded a 5-star Food Hygiene Rating in August 2024. The management team in place at the time of that inspection is the same team managing The White Swan today and our commitment to maintaining high standards and providing a safe and welcoming environment for our customers has remained unchanged.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
	&amp;nbsp;We want to reassure our customers and the local community that food safety and hygiene remain extremely important to us. We are continuing to operate with high standards and are committed to maintaining and improving these at all times.&lt;/p&gt;
